    <tags>brother ql-700 ql700 printer label driver hardware admin</tags>
    <summary>Windows printer driver for the Brother QL-700 label printer.</summary>
    <description>Installs Brother's printer driver for the QL-700 label printer.

This package installs only the printer driver. It does not install P-touch Editor or other Brother utilities. Windows on ARM is not supported by the vendor.

For unattended installation, the package adds the exact Brother code-signing certificate used by this driver to the local machine's Trusted Publishers certificate store.</description>
    <releaseNotes>Packages Brother Printer Driver 6.5.0c, released 18 February 2025.</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
